Responsible operator: gamelauncher
If you have any queries, contact gamelauncer223@gmail.com.

What we use and why
Your chosen display name is saved on this phone and shown to approved room members. A nickname is enough. Room names, member names, local network addresses and timing information let nearby devices discover, connect and play together. Microphone or app audio is processed when you start sharing, to play it on the selected devices. Audio may identify people or contain private information. Share only audio you are entitled to share.

Who receives it
Approved room devices receive room/member names and shared audio through encrypted connections after both people compare and confirm the security code. Discovery reveals a room code and connection address on the local network, but no username or audio. The app has no advertising, analytics or cloud audio service. Recipients can hear or independently record audio; leaving cannot recall what they already heard.

Storage and deletion
Audio is temporarily buffered in memory for playback; the app does not save audio recordings. Room information is cleared when you leave. Your display name and the notice version, acceptance time and record that you continued after this notice stay in private app storage until you withdraw and delete. Continuing after this updated notice removes any age declaration, guardian approval and request reference saved by an earlier version. We do not ask for your birth date or identity documents. App backup is disabled. Privacy requests sent to gamelauncher are handled separately; legally required records may have to be retained and the operator must explain applicable retention.

Your choice
Pressing Continue confirms agreement to these terms and the described personal-data uses for nearby audio rooms. You can decline and exit. Stop sharing or leave a room at any time. Privacy & your data lets you withdraw consent and delete local profile/consent data; this ends sharing and disconnects this device. Rejoining requires consent again. Android microphone/sharing permission is requested separately.

Age requirement
Beatrazeem is for people aged 9 and older. This version does not ask you to declare your age and does not verify age or parental consent. This version does not provide a parent or lawful-guardian approval process.

Contact and your choices
View your local data on this screen, correct your display name in Profile, or withdraw and delete. Contact gamelauncer223@gmail.com for access to processing/sharing information, correction, erasure, guardian withdrawal, or nomination of someone to exercise your rights in the event of death or incapacity. Proportionate verification may be required. Send your query or request directly from your email app. Do not include passwords, identity documents or private audio. Our service policy is acknowledgement within 7 days and resolution within 30 days. If unresolved after this process, you may approach the Data Protection Board when the applicable mechanism and provisions are in force. Official information: https://www.meity.gov.in/data-protection-framework''';
